{"4224090": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Powerfuel", "steam_appid": 4224090, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced FPS gameplay meets the elemental abilities of the Powerfuels. Fight through hordes of enemies as a one-man army, wielding the elements to burn, freeze, and electrify everything in your path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn the battlefield into a deadly weapon: exploit the environment to your advantage, creating slowing zones, raging flames, and explosive chain reactions to wipe out anyone who stands against you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4224090/extras/25fc084b0760e10eabe28aafc89932ce.poster.avif?t=1776946140\" width=1170 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4224090/extras/25fc084b0760e10eabe28aafc89932ce.webm?t=1776946140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4224090/extras/25fc084b0760e10eabe28aafc89932ce.mp4?t=1776946140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of the infamous Cricket, an ex-criminal now working on the side of the law. After losing his legs in the war, the Cricket was equipped with a pair of mechanical legs that give him the ability to dash, hence the nickname.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >His knowledge and experience, coupled with the weapons at his disposal, make him a deadly enemy for the gangs scattered across New Lyon, though his motives remain unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4224090/extras/338687dc11e52eca260fa15590637606.avif?t=1776946140\" width=1280 height=420 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It has been 15 years since the end of the Great War, when the US government publicly announced the discovery of magic. Thanks to it, a new resource began to spread across the country, reshaping it overnight: Powerfuels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New Lyon, home city of magic’s &quot;inventor,&quot; found itself at the center of an industrial boom that transformed the United States into an economic powerhouse, filling the city with factories and commerce.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yet this age of prosperity came with its own shadows, as crime began to rise in the suburban areas of the country’s major cities, and New Lyon was no exception. Now, in the beating heart of the new world, rumors of a conspiracy have begun to surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4224090/extras/b5c6658db71bb41ade735a18c3bdfa44.avif?t=1776946140\" width=1280 height=420 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced FPS gameplay meets the elemental abilities of the Powerfuels. Fight through hordes of enemies as a one-man army, wielding the elements to burn, freeze, and electrify everything in your path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn the battlefield into a deadly weapon: exploit the environment to your advantage, creating slowing zones, raging flames, and explosive chain reactions to wipe out anyone who stands against you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4224090/extras/25fc084b0760e10eabe28aafc89932ce.poster.avif?t=1776946140\" width=1170 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4224090/extras/25fc084b0760e10eabe28aafc89932ce.webm?t=1776946140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4224090/extras/25fc084b0760e10eabe28aafc89932ce.mp4?t=1776946140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of the infamous Cricket, an ex-criminal now working on the side of the law. After losing his legs in the war, the Cricket was equipped with a pair of mechanical legs that give him the ability to dash, hence the nickname.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >His knowledge and experience, coupled with the weapons at his disposal, make him a deadly enemy for the gangs scattered across New Lyon, though his motives remain unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4224090/extras/338687dc11e52eca260fa15590637606.avif?t=1776946140\" width=1280 height=420 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It has been 15 years since the end of the Great War, when the US government publicly announced the discovery of magic. Thanks to it, a new resource began to spread across the country, reshaping it overnight: Powerfuels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New Lyon, home city of magic’s &quot;inventor,&quot; found itself at the center of an industrial boom that transformed the United States into an economic powerhouse, filling the city with factories and commerce.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yet this age of prosperity came with its own shadows, as crime began to rise in the suburban areas of the country’s major cities, and New Lyon was no exception. Now, in the beating heart of the new world, rumors of a conspiracy have begun to surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4224090/extras/b5c6658db71bb41ade735a18c3bdfa44.avif?t=1776946140\" width=1280 height=420 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Powerfuel is an action FPS set in a gritty dieselpunk world. Play as the legendary ex-criminal known as the Cricket, and harness the mystical properties of powerfuels. Fight your way through the gangs of New Lyon and shed light on the conspiracy plaguing the city.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4224090/32fc7134ba568ed7a6a4c6015b2f99d3a9943314/header.jpg?t=1776946140", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4224090/83b55dc53751af4b35b3cfdb1b324e25afd389c3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1776946140", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4224090/83b55dc53751af4b35b3cfdb1b324e25afd389c3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1776946140", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11 x64<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-8700K / Ryzen 7 5800X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce RTX 2060 or AMD Radeon RX 5700<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Windows Compatible Audio Device</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Reforged Studios"], "publishers": ["AIV - Accademia Italiana Videogiochi"], "demos": [{"appid": 4406920, "description": ""}], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 55, "description": "DualShock Controller Support"}, {"id": 18, "description": "Partial Controller Support"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sha